      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: yea that's right, you are falling out of the map. And we noticed the issue when we meet the person at spawn. Only a couple (I think 2 of 7) of us couldn't see his avatar. I were able to open the menu and point at him to see his Avatar pill while others were pointing at him with there fingers to show me where he is.\n\nI tried to reproduce it with my own avatars to make a video of it but I couldn't reproduce it so far. I have seen a lot of reports about seat issues with WD ON setups. All my avatars are WD OFF. This might be the reason why I can't reproduce it myself. I also noticed I posted this in live category, but it happened on open beta.",
